---
description: Twig templates and public assets (this bundle ships none; demo templates only)
globs:
  - "demo/**/templates/**/*.twig"
  - "demo/**/public/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

This bundle ships no Twig templates, no Twig namespace and no `src/Resources/public` assets (it is a Cloud API transport).
Twig exists only in the demo (`demo/symfony8/templates`).

Prefer:
- small, backward-compatible demo template changes that preserve the current block structure
- Symfony Form Types rendered with `form_start` / the rendered-aware child loop / `form_end` (REQ-TWIG-003 / REQ-TWIG-005)
- reusing existing classes, ids and hooks

Do not hand-write raw `<form>`, `<input>`, `<textarea>` or `<select>` in demo templates (`make check-no-raw-html-form` fails).
Do not add bundle templates or public assets without updating README, docs and the release checklist.
